{
  "name": "dsh-fuse",
  "version": "1.2.4",
  "description": "Fuse v1.2.4 — 根级 actions 渲染（主操作不再消失）+ 按钮 label/tone 字段兼容 + 点击不再双发指令 + 对比度守卫（WCAG，修正 5 处令牌违规）+ 令牌漂移守卫 + 客户端 bundle 迁入 lib/； UI 设计 + 代码规范一体化插件（ui-aesthetics 技能升级版）：设计令牌 theme.json（含品牌色单一事实来源）+ 代码规范 code-style.json + dsh-fuse fence 页面级渲染 + 走查器像素级微调 + 撤销历史 + 渲染状态回传（Spec valid≠Render correct）+ 通用适配流程与风格扩展；插件 UI 壳按功能设计语言（设计工作台/蓝紫）+ 深色模式适配（DSH 主题 dsw-alias 跟随，双通道探测）。v1.2.3：规格校验器抽为 spec-validator.mjs 单一事实来源——宿主 import、client.js 由 npm run build:client 注入生成区间，--check 与单测双重防漂移；v1.2.2：steps 去掉 innerHTML 注入、节点预算 60 真正生效且宿主/前端同构（含 tabs 内容递归）、撤销快照只收完整非流式状态",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.mjs",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.mjs",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.mjs",
    "spec-validator.mjs",
    "lib",
    "config",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "SKILL.md",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build:client": "node scripts/build-client.mjs",
    "check:client": "node scripts/build-client.mjs --check",
    "test": "node --test tests/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "jsdom": "^25.0.0",
    "react": "^18.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^18.3.1"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-system-prompt": ">=0.1.1-rc.2"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-system-prompt": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/KLRSL/dsh-fuse.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/KLRSL/dsh-fuse#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/KLRSL/dsh-fuse/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "ui",
    "fuse",
    "design-tokens",
    "code-style",
    "fence",
    "renderer"
  ]
}
